{"id":"0eb06f5a064870f0","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-many-sorted-terms.md","title":"Many-sorted terms","display":"df-many-sorted-terms — Many-sorted terms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-many-sorted-terms","aliases":["56-df-many-sorted-terms"],"display":"df-many-sorted-terms — Many-sorted terms","depends_on":["[[56-df-many-sorted-signature]]","[[56-df-terms]]"],"source_section":"§6.5.6","source_printed_pages":"256","source_ocr_blocks":[277],"source_verification":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-many-sorted-terms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-many-sorted-terms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-many-sorted-terms — Many-sorted terms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d8a892f85575c609\" href=\"?note=d8a892f85575c609\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-signature\">56-df-many-sorted-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.5.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"256"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>277</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,\\mathcal F,a,b)\">\\(M=(S,\\mathcal F,a,b)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\circ}\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\circ}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d8a892f85575c609\" href=\"?note=d8a892f85575c609\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-signature\">56-df-many-sorted-signature</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal V_s)_{s\\in S}\">\\((\\mathcal V_s)_{s\\in S}\\)</span> 为变量集合族，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal V_s|=\\aleph_0\">\\(|\\mathcal V_s|=\\aleph_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_s\\cap\\mathcal F=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathcal V_s\\cap\\mathcal F=\\varnothing\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\ne q\\Rightarrow\\mathcal V_s\\cap\\mathcal V_q=\\varnothing\">\\(s\\ne q\\Rightarrow\\mathcal V_s\\cap\\mathcal V_q=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>自由项构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 与构造器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\">\\(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a>；不同根、不同参数列及变量给出不同语法对象。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_\\bullet\">\\(\\mathcal V_\\bullet\\)</span> 表示已给定的族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal V_s)_{s\\in S}\">\\((\\mathcal V_s)_{s\\in S}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{s\\in S}\\mathcal V_s,\\qquad\nT^{\\circ}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma^{\\circ},\\mathcal V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal V\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{s\\in S}\\mathcal V_s,\\qquad\nT^{\\circ}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma^{\\circ},\\mathcal V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{s,0}\\coloneqq\\mathcal V_s\\qquad(s\\in S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{s,0}\\coloneqq\\mathcal V_s\\qquad(s\\in S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{s,n+1}\\coloneqq T_{s,n}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{\\substack{f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ (s_1,\\ldots,s_k)\\in S^k\\\\\na(f)=(s_1,\\ldots,s_k),\\ b(f)=s}}\n\\{f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\mid(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in\\prod_{i=1}^{k}T_{s_i,n}\\}\n\\qquad(s\\in S,\\ n\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{s,n+1}\\coloneqq T_{s,n}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{\\substack{f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ (s_1,\\ldots,s_k)\\in S^k\\\\\na(f)=(s_1,\\ldots,s_k),\\ b(f)=s}}\n\\{f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\mid(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in\\prod_{i=1}^{k}T_{s_i,n}\\}\n\\qquad(s\\in S,\\ n\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_s(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T_{s,n},\\qquad\nT_s\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_s(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_s(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T_{s,n},\\qquad\nT_s\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_s(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{s\\in S}T_s.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{s\\in S}T_s.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限层并集实现原书的同时归纳生成，排除仅要求对构造器封闭而允许额外对象的解释。空参数列时空积是仅含空序列的集合，因而常元在第一层进入其输出排序。以项高度归纳可得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_s\\subseteq T^{\\circ}\">\\(T_s\\subseteq T^{\\circ}\\)</span>；有限非空排序集与每排序可数无限的变量族使总变量集兼容本目录的变量约定。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，§6.5.6，印刷第256页，OCR页块277。原书用两条归纳生成规则定义排序项；本地采用有限阶段的显式集合构造。每排序可数无限变量是为复用本目录一阶项接口而固定的变量供给约定，排序原理不依赖该基数。已比对排序项生成陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-many-sorted-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d8a892f85575c609","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-many-sorted-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-many-sorted-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d8a892f85575c609","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(S,\\mathcal F,a,b)$、$\\Sigma^{\\circ}$ 如 [[56-df-many-sorted-signature]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"自由项构造 $\\mathcal T$ 与构造器 $f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)$ 取 [[56-df-terms]]；不同根、不同参数列及变量给出不同语法对象。以下 $\\mathcal V_\\bullet$ 表示已给定的族 $(\\mathcal V_s)_{s\\in S}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,\\mathcal F,a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{\\circ}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathcal V_s)_{s\\in S}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathcal V_s|=\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_s\\cap\\mathcal F=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"s\\ne q\\Rightarrow\\mathcal V_s\\cap\\mathcal V_q=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_\\bullet","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathcal V_s)_{s\\in S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{s\\in S}\\mathcal V_s,\\qquad\nT^{\\circ}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma^{\\circ},\\mathcal V).","display":true},{"tex":"T_{s,0}\\coloneqq\\mathcal V_s\\qquad(s\\in S).","display":true},{"tex":"T_{s,n+1}\\coloneqq T_{s,n}\\cup\n\\bigcup_{\\substack{f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ (s_1,\\ldots,s_k)\\in S^k\\\\\na(f)=(s_1,\\ldots,s_k),\\ b(f)=s}}\n\\{f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\mid(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in\\prod_{i=1}^{k}T_{s_i,n}\\}\n\\qquad(s\\in S,\\ n\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_s(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T_{s,n},\\qquad\nT_s\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_s(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet).","display":true},{"tex":"T_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{s\\in S}T_s.","display":true},{"tex":"T_s\\subseteq T^{\\circ}","display":false}],"bytes":2425,"backlinks":[{"id":"4f47f83c51f651d3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M$、$\\mathcal V_\\bullet$、$\\mathcal V$、$T_s$、$T_S$ 与 $T^{\\circ}$ 如 [[56-df-many-sorted-terms]]；排序替换集见 [[56-df-many-sorted-substitution]]。"},{"id":"2d69158e5cbd8317","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M$、$\\mathcal V_\\bullet$、$\\mathcal V$、$T_s$、$T_S$ 与 $T^{\\circ}$ 如 [[56-df-many-sorted-terms]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-327","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-many-sorted-terms.md]]"}],"outgoing":["d8a892f85575c609","5e02461ce48023cc"]}